  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="8263c01f-3730-5357-bc1b-926036750000" activityNameId="374c6e7e-56d8-58e3-a550-39a8a5e08b38" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pellets, mixed, burned in furnace 50kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pellets, mixed, burned in furnace 50kW
Heat of combustion of wood pellets based on lower heating value. 2100 operating hours per year. Air emission factors are calculated from the weighted average of measurements of pellet furnaces;
UUID: d6b48214-f467-3eb2-a7ef-b11c351c7dd4
This module describes the combustion of wood pellets. Included are the infrastructure, the wood requirements (average pellets, u=33%), the emissions to air, the transport of the fuel, the electricity needed for operation, and the disposal of the ashes.
Location: Could be used for central European conditions
Technology: Boiler of average technology available on market
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d6b48214-f467-3eb2-a7ef-b11c351c7dd4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
